# Xojo (formerly REALbasic and Real Studio)

Builds*
*.debug
*.debug.app
Debug*.exe
Debug*/Debug*.exe
Debug*/Debug*\ Libs
*.rbuistate
*.xojo_uistate
*.obsolete*
.DS_store

# Claude Code worktrees / scratch space
.claude/

# Secrets - the real secrets file lives OUTSIDE the repo
# (/etc/ECHOINDICATIONS/secrets.env). Only secrets.env.example is committed.
secrets.env

# JetBrains IDE project files (may carry datasource/connection details)
.idea/

# Database dumps - contain user PII and password hashes; must not be committed.
# Schema-only migration / seed scripts (decision_nodes_*.sql, *_migration.sql)
# are fine to keep tracked - it's the data dumps below that are the concern.
echo_indications_data.sql
echo_indications_schema+data.sql
echo_indications schema.sql
schema & data.sql

